        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38960.\">fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2970913159\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38960\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38960/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38960\">mdn/content#38960</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spec guys have dropped the <code class=\"notranslate\">:host-context()</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"269271836\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/1914\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/1914/hovercard?comment_id=2737310093&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/1914#issuecomment-2737310093\">w3c/csswg-drafts#1914 (comment)</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27680",
            "title": "Mark css.selectors.host-context deprecated",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-27T02:31:53.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-27T02:31:16.000Z",
