        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531417?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix compatibility data of <code class=\"notranslate\">api.HTMLSlotElement.assign</code> for Chromium.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27537.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3305477008\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27537\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27537/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27537\">#27537</a>.</p>",
